      "title": "Llama 3.1 - 405B, 70B & 8B with multilinguality and long context",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/blog/llama31",
      "snippet": "Llama 3.1 405B quantization with FP8, AWQ, and GPTQ Meta created an official FP8 quantized version of Llama 3.1 405B with minimal accuracy degradation. To achieve this, FP8 quantization was only applied to the major linear operators of the model, such as the gate and up and down projections for the FFNs (covering 75% of the inference FLOPs)."
